"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Rainfall / Seismic Data","Geospatial Data Platform","GIS + Digital Terrain Model","Physics + AI Models","Hazard Forecast","Exposure / Vulnerability","Risk Assessment","Early Warning / Decision Support"]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DISASTER MANAGEMENT"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"ENGINEERING GEOLOGY"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"GEOMORPHOLOGY"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"GEOTECHNICAL ENGINEERING"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"SOIL / ROCK MECHANICS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"SLOPE STABILITY"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"LANDSLIDE ANALYSIS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"SEISMIC HAZARD"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"LIQUEFACTION"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"HYDROLOGY"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"REMOTE SENSING"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"InSAR"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"PYTHON / SQL / POSTGIS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"NUMERICAL MODELLING"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"MACHINE LEARNING"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"RISK ASSESSMENT"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"EARLY WARNING SYSTEMS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"DIGITAL TWINS"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"By the end of B.Tech/B.E., the student should be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Identify major geological hazards"},{"text":"Understand geological and geomorphological processes"},{"text":"Analyze basic slope stability"},{"text":"Understand landslide triggering mechanisms"},{"text":"Assess rockfall and debris-flow hazards"},{"text":"Understand earthquake and seismic hazards"},{"text":"Analyze liquefaction fundamentals"},{"text":"Understand ground deformation and subsidence"},{"text":"Perform GIS terrain analysis"},{"text":"Process DEMs"},{"text":"Create landslide susceptibility maps"},{"text":"Process satellite imagery"},{"text":"Understand InSAR principles"},{"text":"Use remote sensing for hazard detection"},{"text":"Conduct basic field investigations"},{"text":"Understand soil and rock testing"},{"text":"Perform hazard and risk assessments"},{"text":"Analyze exposure and vulnerability"},{"text":"Develop basic early-warning architectures"},{"text":"Use Python for geospatial and hazard analytics"},{"text":"Use SQL/PostGIS for spatial datasets"},{"text":"Apply machine learning to hazard datasets"},{"text":"Build hazard dashboards"},{"text":"Communicate technical findings through professional risk reports"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong portfolio should contain 5–7 substantial geohazard projects."},{"type":"h","text":"1. Landslide Susceptibility Mapping"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DEM"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Geology"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Rainfall"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Land Use"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Roads"},{"text":"+"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Drainage","GIS / ML Model","Landslide Susceptibility Map"]},{"type":"h","text":"2. InSAR Ground-Deformation Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze satellite time-series data to identify ground movement in a suitable study region."},{"type":"h","text":"3. Slope Stability Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a slope model and evaluate stability under:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Normal conditions"},{"text":"Saturated conditions"},{"text":"Increased pore pressure"},{"text":"Seismic loading"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Rainfall-Based Early Warning System"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a prototype using:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Rainfall","Soil Moisture","Slope Information → Hazard Alert"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"5. Earthquake Risk Map"},{"type":"p","text":"Combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Seismic Hazard","Population","Infrastructure","Vulnerability"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"6. Geohazard Infrastructure Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Map:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Roads"},{"text":"Railways"},{"text":"Bridges"},{"text":"Dams"},{"text":"Buildings"},{"text":"Hazard zones"}]},{"type":"h","text":"7. Multi-Hazard Digital Twin"},{"type":"p","text":"Combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["GIS","Terrain","Satellite Data","Sensors","Hazard Models","Infrastructure Exposure"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"A disaster management engineering professional specializing in geohazard analysis, combining engineering geology, geomorphology, geotechnical engineering, slope stability, seismic hazards, hydrology, GIS, remote sensing, InSAR, numerical modelling, risk assessment and AI-driven geospatial analytics to identify, model and reduce natural-hazard risks to communities and critical infrastructure."},{"type":"h","text":"Strongest positioning"},{"type":"flow","items":["Geohazards","Geotechnical Engineering","GIS/Remote Sensing","Risk Analytics","Early Warning"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest progression is:"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Tech/B.E. Disaster Management Engineering → Geohazard Intern → Junior Geohazard Analyst → Geohazard Analyst → Senior Geohazard Specialist → Principal Geohazard Consultant → Geohazard/Risk Lead."}]}]}